From: pocket-debs <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] spacebar: choose the SIM of a message
Description:
 With several SIMs a message goes through the SIM the latest received
 message of the conversation came in on, else through the default SIM (a
 new setting, the first SIM without a choice). A button next to the send
 button shows the icon of that SIM and lets the user send the next message
 through another SIM; the choice is not remembered. With one SIM nothing
 changes.
 .
 Needs the daemon of this version (sendMessage with the SIM, sims()).
Forwarded: no
License: as the patched files (GPL-2.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only OR LicenseRef-KDE-Accepted-GPL)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
---
